{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img alt=\"「VIRTUA FIGHTER CROSSROADS」新預告片公開！新角色「Lionel Rafale」登場\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"504\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/09c0055d57dbeafca714bda8d019f7f797a4300d78b912934bea511f7cc04505/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fc91ef14333e433d4d16ab3d8daf1b0a6.jpg\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption>「VIRTUA FIGHTER CROSSROADS」新預告片公開！新角色「Lionel Rafale」登場</figcaption></figure><p>株式會社SEGA公開了預定2027年發售的「<strong>VIRTUA FIGHTER CROSSROADS</strong>(擬真格鬥 命運交鋒)」最新影像。<br/>公開了於故事中登場的新角色「<strong>Lionel Rafale</strong>」。</p><h2>「VIRTUA FIGHTER CROSSROADS」新角色「Lionel Rafale」登場！</h2><blockquote><p></p></blockquote><p>株式會社SEGA於2026年10月30日(五)0時(UTC+9)公開了「<strong>VIRTUA FIGHTER CROSSROADS</strong>」的最新影像。<br/>公開了新角色「<strong>Lionel Rafale</strong>」。</p><p></p><figure><img alt=\"Lionel Rafale\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/c847f9265ef8d7100a7ecaeda65f2176a29dfe4b9acf38c93240bd4da6755ffa/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F1ff3ce88da8169737b4a1020d95d42a7.jpg\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption>Lionel Rafale</figcaption></figure><p>Lionel是現身於故事舞台維拉薩帕拉街區的年輕格鬥家。<br/>然而他造訪維拉薩帕拉的目的為何仍不明朗。</p><p><p></p><p><p></p><p></p><p></p></p></p><a href=\"https://i0.wp.com/uploads.saigacdn.com/2026/10/virtua-fighter-crossroads-lionel-rafale-trailer-02.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><p><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/6579fce5aa07a1fe89c11a9f62b6a1e58a45933c0d16efbbc66d7a04272b1e28/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fb4be78f2523d41c66851eb5ff06b49c0.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></p></a><a href=\"https://i0.wp.com/uploads.saigacdn.com/2026/10/virtua-fighter-crossroads-lionel-rafale-trailer-03.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><p><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/ce56ade930378bf3ba85990c8b7759a045b682768c217c7e0a99bd03d7c43450/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F5cb3fa391a57865469af9bd32c4920c9.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></p></a><p>在街頭格鬥中，是足以壓倒主角Cielo的實力者。<br/>在預告片中，也名副其實地將Cielo踩在腳下。</p><figure><img alt=\"螳螂拳的架式\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/07f8ee4f513525ce8b647e5d63b57d54ed6c98fd841378f7fc0199d73a837c79/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Ffbb95e4b75ac5f01038efd0d75342257.jpg\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption>螳螂拳的架式</figcaption></figure><a href=\"https://i0.wp.com/uploads.saigacdn.com/2026/10/virtua-fighter-crossroads-lionel-rafale-trailer-05.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"圧倒的財力\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/279d65acbd186127d2b40a621adb77954190d54fbe0d3f16369f92f0bd22e5ac/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fa3fd6d9f76daaa071ce371259b5744e9.png\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption>圧倒的財力</figcaption></a><a href=\"https://i0.wp.com/uploads.saigacdn.com/2026/10/virtua-fighter-crossroads-lionel-rafale-trailer-06.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"酒を飲むリオネル・ラファール\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/567119d7865d956b59881d4ce06adb2a60437301027bd1c02476dfbf43767756/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F721db7cecf7752bc05654bb8eed6ea0b.png\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption>酒を飲むリオネル・ラファール</figcaption></a><p>架式為螳螂拳、姓氏為Rafale，以及談及父親的台詞。<br/>若是過去Virtual Fighter系列的粉絲，肯定會不禁想起<a href=\"https://virtua-fighter.com/revo/jp/character/details/chara10.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Lion Rafale</a>的新角色「Lionel Rafale」<br/>敬請關注其充滿謎團的存在與超凡的強大。</p><p>詳情與後續報導請確認<a href=\"https://crossroads.virtua-fighter.com/jp/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">「VIRTUA FIGHTER CROSSROADS」官方網站</a>或官方X(<a href=\"https://x.com/VFCR_JP\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">@VFCR_JP</a>)。</p><blockquote><p></p><p>VIRTUA FIGHTER CROSSROADS<br/>⠀<br/>「Les jeux sont faits, rien ne va plus」<br/>⠀<br/>ヴィラサパラの街に現れた、<br/>若き格闘家リオネル<br/>⠀<br/>ストリートファイトでシエロを圧倒するほどの実力の持ち主だが、彼は何が目的でこの街に来たのだろうか<br/>⠀<a href=\"https://x.com/hashtag/VFCR?src=hash&amp;ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">#VFCR</a><a href=\"https://x.com/hashtag/%E3%83%90%E3%83%BC%E3%83%81%E3%83%A3%E3%83%95%E3%82%A1%E3%82%A4%E3%82%BF%E3%83%BC?src=hash&amp;ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">#バーチャファイター</a><a href=\"https://t.co/m6xLZqWrNG\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">pic.twitter.com/m6xLZqWrNG</a></p><p>— VIRTUA FIGHTER CROSSROADS 公式 (@VFCR_JP) <a href=\"https://x.com/VFCR_JP/status/2115821621319766458?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">October 29, 2026</a></p></blockquote><p>The post <a href=\"https://saiganak.com/zh/news/virtua-fighter-crossroads-lionel-rafale-trailer/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">「VIRTUA FIGHTER CROSSROADS」新預告片公開！新角色「Lionel Rafale」登場</a> first appeared on <a href=\"https://saiganak.com/zh\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Saiga NAK</a>. </p><hr/><h4>延伸閱讀</h4><p><a href=\"https://saiganak.com/zh/release/roblox-yakuza-blocks-like-a-dragon/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">🔸「Yakuza Blocks: Like a Dragon」在 Roblox 上線！自由探索神室町，盡情享受戰鬥與多人連線樂趣</a><br/><a href=\"https://saiganak.com/zh/event/p4re-trial-event-announcement/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">🔸「女神異聞錄4 Revival」決定於日本全國6間店鋪舉辦店頭體驗會！試玩特典與小熊的見面會也有</a><br/><a href=\"https://saiganak.com/zh/news/atlus-halloween-sale-2026/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">🔸Atlas 旗下遊戲「萬聖節特賣」現正熱烈進行中！「女神異聞錄」系列最高可享 80% 折扣</a><br/><a href=\"https://saiganak.com/zh/news/canva-puyopuyo-official-template-collection/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">🔸「Canva」開始提供紀念「魔法氣泡」35週年的官方範本集！用「魔法氣泡」點綴遊戲大賽與學校生活吧</a><br/><a href=\"https://saiganak.com/zh/news/stranger-than-heaven-kokura-trailer/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">🔸《STRANGER THAN HEAVEN》公開第一部「福岡・小倉」故事預告片！大東真抵達日本後的第一座城市</a></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-30T06:25:35.487034+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1230,"images":7,"source":"Yahoo 科技","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-30T05:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T07:22:24.507658+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-30T06:20:29.122098+00:00","content_hash":"2843440979c864c08b2d9396531cd80390fb7a47a582697e7f35ff86610d9c5d","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}